    {
      "title": "二次式",
      "prompt": "$\\lim_{x\\to3} \\frac{x^2 - x - 6}{x - 3}$",
      "problemId": "fd-lim-003",
      "steps": [
        "代 $x = 3$：$9 - 3 - 6 = 0$，分母 0，是 $\\frac{0}{0}$。所以分子有 $(x - 3)$ 這個因式。",
        "十字交乘：$x^2 - x - 6 = (x - 3)(x + 2)$。",
        "$x \\ne 3$，約掉 $x - 3$，剩 $x + 2$。",
        "代 $x = 3$：5。"
      ],
      "answer": "5",
      "claim": "x^2-x-6 == (x-3)(x+2) ;; LIM((x^2-x-6)/(x-3), 3) == 5"
    },
    {
      "title": "立方差與平方差",
      "prompt": "$\\lim_{x\\to1} \\frac{x^3 - 1}{x^2 - 1}$",
      "problemId": "lec-01-q1b",
      "steps": [
        "代 $x = 1$：$\\frac{0}{0}$。",
        "分子立方差：$x^3 - 1 = (x - 1)(x^2 + x + 1)$。分母平方差：$x^2 - 1 = (x - 1)(x + 1)$。",
        "約掉 $x - 1$：$\\frac{x^2 + x + 1}{x + 1}$。",
        "代 $x = 1$：$\\frac{3}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{3}{2}$",
      "claim": "x^3-1 == (x-1)(x^2+x+1) ;; LIM((x^3-1)/(x^2-1), 1) == 3/2"
    },
    {
      "title": "要約兩次",
      "prompt": "$\\lim_{x\\to1} \\frac{x^3 - 3x + 2}{x^2 - 2x + 1}$",
      "steps": [
        "代 $x = 1$：分子 $1 - 3 + 2 = 0$，分母 $1 - 2 + 1 = 0$。",
        "分子除以 $(x - 1)$：$x^3 - 3x + 2 = (x - 1)(x^2 + x - 2)$。$x^2 + x - 2$ 在 1 也是 0，再拆：$(x - 1)(x + 2)$。所以分子 $= (x - 1)^2(x + 2)$。",
        "分母 $= (x - 1)^2$。",
        "約掉 $(x - 1)^2$：剩 $x + 2$，代 $x = 1$ 得 3。只約一次會得到 $\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 2)}{(x - 1)^2}$，代入仍是 $\\frac{0}{0}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "3",
      "claim": "x^3-3x+2 == (x-1)^2(x+2) ;; LIM((x^3-3x+2)/(x^2-2x+1), 1) == 3"
    }
